# Git Commit Message Rules

When generating git commit messages:

- Always write in Chinese.
- Use Conventional Commits format.
- Keep messages concise.
- Describe the user-facing change.

Format:

<type>: <中文描述>

Examples:

feat: 新增 AI 额度查询功能

fix: 修复菜单栏刷新失败问题

refactor: 重构 API 请求逻辑